{"id":5285,"date":"2020-11-16T16:03:26","date_gmt":"2020-11-16T15:03:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/?p=5285"},"modified":"2022-12-02T11:02:43","modified_gmt":"2022-12-02T10:02:43","slug":"commemoration-du-11-novembre","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/commemoration-du-11-novembre\/","title":{"rendered":"Comm\u00e9moration du 11 novembre"},"content":{"rendered":"<p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><strong>Compte-tenu de la situation exceptionnelle li\u00e9e \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9tat d\u2019urgence sanitaire et aux mesures de confinement, la C\u00e9r\u00e9monie de comm\u00e9moration de l\u2019armistice \u00e9tait ferm\u00e9e au public.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><!--more--><\/p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">Ce mercredi 11 novembre, Vincent DEBES et Alain ROBUCHON, Conseiller d\u00e9fense ainsi que M. le D\u00e9put\u00e9 Bruno STUDER et M. Yves SEGUY, Sous-Pr\u00e9fet ont d\u00e9pos\u00e9 une gerbe en m\u00e9moire des soldats morts pour la France au cours de la Grande Guerre, en pr\u00e9sence de M. Jean-Claude HEITMANN, Premier Adjoint.<\/p>\n<p>La sonnerie aux Morts et la Marseillaise ont retenti.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Depuis la loi du 28 f\u00e9vrier 2012, le\u00a011 novembre est le jour anniversaire de l\u2019armistice sign\u00e9 en 1918 \u00e0 Rethondes dans l&rsquo;Oise mais aussi de la comm\u00e9moration annuelle de la victoire et de la paix. Ce jour-l\u00e0, il est rendu hommage \u00e0 tous les morts pour la France.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Se recueillir chaque ann\u00e9e devant le monument aux morts, c\u2019est avoir une pens\u00e9e toute particuli\u00e8re pour nos p\u00e8res morts au combat pour notre libert\u00e9, pour lesquels nous avons le devoir de m\u00e9moire envers nos enfants et les g\u00e9n\u00e9rations \u00e0 venir. <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Aujourd\u2019hui, cette comm\u00e9moration rev\u00eat \u00e0 plus d\u2019un titre, une dimension particuli\u00e8re. <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">2020 marque le 100e anniversaire du transfert de la d\u00e9pouille du soldat inconnu, <\/span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">du Panth\u00e9on vers l\u2019Arc de Triomphe. <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Malheureusement, <\/span><span lang=\"fr-FR\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">l\u2019<\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">inconnu<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span> rev\u00eat aussi en ces temps de crise, pour nous, un autre visage. <\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Inconnu<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">, c\u2019est aujourd\u2019hui, l\u2019autre nom de notre ennemi commun, le coronavirus \u201dCOVID-19\u201d. <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Depuis plusieurs mois, cette pand\u00e9mie endurcit le quotidien de tous, elle est devenue notre combat \u00e0 tous dans une lutte sanitaire face \u00e0 un ennemi invisible et mortel. A ce jour, il est la cause de plus de 40.000 morts en France et plus d\u20191 million 250.000 mille morts dans le monde.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Aujourd&rsquo;hui nos militaires, hommes et femmes se battent bien souvent au p\u00e9ril de leur vie tout au long de l\u2019ann\u00e9e lors d\u2019op\u00e9rations ext\u00e9rieures. Un personnel \u00e9galement engag\u00e9 sur notre territoire, \u00e0 l\u2019exemple du montage en mars dernier, d\u2019un h\u00f4pital militaire de campagne \u00e0 Mulhouse, par le <\/span><span style=\"color: #e4af0a;\"><span lang=\"fr-FR\"><u><a href=\"https:\/\/fr.wikipedia.org\/wiki\/Service_de_sant%C3%A9_des_arm%C3%A9es\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Service de sant\u00e9 des arm\u00e9es<\/span><\/a><\/u><\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"> et le <\/span><span style=\"color: #e4af0a;\"><span lang=\"fr-FR\"><u><a href=\"https:\/\/fr.wikipedia.org\/wiki\/R%C3%A9giment_m%C3%A9dical\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">r\u00e9giment m\u00e9dical<\/span><\/a><\/u><\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"> de l&rsquo;<\/span><span style=\"color: #e4af0a;\"><span lang=\"fr-FR\"><u><a href=\"https:\/\/fr.wikipedia.org\/wiki\/Arm%C3%A9e_de_terre_(France)\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Arm\u00e9e de terre fran\u00e7aise<\/span><\/a><\/u><\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Dans ce combat, nos services de sant\u00e9, nos administrations, nos entreprises et nos familles engag\u00e9es dans la lutte contre la propagations du virus ne sont pas oubli\u00e9s. <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\"><em><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Ensemble, <\/span><span lang=\"fr-FR\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">restons <\/span><\/span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">unis contre ce virus, <\/span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span lang=\"fr-FR\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">restons <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span>chez nous autant que faire se peut, <\/span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span lang=\"fr-FR\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">restons <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span>prudents et prot\u00e9geons ceux qui nous entourent.\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/em><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Compte-tenu de la situation exceptionnelle li\u00e9e \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9tat d\u2019urgence sanitaire et aux mesures de confinement, la C\u00e9r\u00e9monie de comm\u00e9moration de l\u2019armistice \u00e9tait ferm\u00e9e au public.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":6,"featured_media":5286,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_expiration-date-status":"","_expiration-date":0,"_expiration-date-type":"","_expiration-date-categories":[],"_expiration-date-options":[]},"categories":[31],"tags":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5285"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/6"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5285"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5285\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5297,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5285\/revisions\/5297"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/5286"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5285"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=5285"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=5285"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}